Data Content: 13 77 6A 72 5A 8D 43 E1 B2 A7 F2 1D C1 DD 7D 3F 03 76 8D 9E 95 96 88 6E CC E1 19 4B FD 1C 5A 14
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
